    "heading": "About PULSE",
    "image": "/assets/images/about.jpg",
    "lead": "Every great community begins with people who choose to show up for one another.",
    "p1": "PULSE exists to turn good intentions into action. We bring students together around causes that matter, and we make it simple to get involved, give back, and see the difference it makes.",
